    <row valign="top">
    <entry valign="middle" align="center">4</entry>
    <entry valign="middle" align="left">
    <list id="list-00002">
    <item>Confidently knows their age, recites their first and last name, and describes who lives with them</item>
    <item>Uses full sentences of at least five words and can be understood most of the time</item>
    <item>Understands rudimentary number concepts and names colors and shapes</item>
    <item>Can organize objects by size and shape</item>
    <item>Copies letters and shapes</item>
    <item>Follows a story and predicts what happens next</item>
