    <entry valign="middle" align="center">6</entry>
    <entry valign="middle" align="left">
    <list id="list-00004">
    <item>Relates people to others, such as “Dad’s sister”</item>
    <item>Speaks using correct grammar most of the time</item>
    <item>Performs simple addition and subtraction</item>
    <item>Understands simple jokes and has a sense of humor</item>
    <item>Writes sentences, though spelling may be incorrect</item>
    <item>Reads simple stories</item>
    <item>Describes full episodes of entertainment programs</item>
    </list>
